# declaration<TAB>owner<TAB>reason. A `*` at either end of a name stands for any text.
# Families whose docs repeat one template on purpose: the sentence is alike because the shape is.
HxFormat*	*	one declarative section type per hxformat.json block, documented from one template
Hx*	*	grammar node types document their keyword and position from one template
Mmd*	*	grammar node types document their syntax from one template
*Parser	*	macro-generated marker classes share one sentence
*Writer	*	macro-generated marker classes share one sentence
*WriteOptions	*	macro-generated marker classes share one sentence
